    /**
     * Resolves the exercise a post is related to, if any.
     * A post is related to an exercise if it lives in a {@link Channel} that is linked to an exercise.
     * The exercise is reloaded from the database so that the concrete subtype (e.g. {@link ProgrammingExercise} or
     * {@link TextExercise}) is available instead of a potential lazy proxy of the base {@link Exercise} type.
